/** Why a section got its slot. `slot_id` the slot's own name, `label` its label, `synonym` a synonym group, `kind` the only slot of its kind (the diagnosis list), `single_slot` the system takes the whole document in one slot, `fallback` no slot fits, `no_slot` the system has no writable text slot. Clients treat an unknown value like `fallback`. */
